      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "§3Louis§r is not a defensive turret - it is a long-range rail cannon that you aim yourself. Enter the target X and Z in its GUI, or send them over Redstone-over-Radio or OpenComputers, and press fire. It calculates the firing angle, charges its 100,000,000 HE capacitor at 250,000 HE/t, and launches the sabot. The charge slowly drains away if you do not fire.\n\nIt takes power from all four sides. Load sabots into its ammo slots - all of them are made in the §3Assembly Machine§r from stainless steel plates and tungsten bolts:\n- T-APFSDS and DU-APFSDS - explosive shells with tungsten or uranium cores.\n- Desh APFSDS - ricochets off the first surface it hits, then explodes.\n- Starmetal APFSDS - faster and more aerodynamic, so it has the longest range.\n- Fluid APFSDS - fill it with a fluid and it sprays a cloud over the target.\n- Nuclear Sabot - a nuclear warhead with schrabidium.",
